mary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering external plugins**\\n\\nI’m thinking I might need to use a web-fetch method or an external plugin, but I’m not entirely sure what the user is asking. It could refer to the openclaw plugin. Searching the web could help, but for that, I’d need a known URL. Maybe executing an npm info command could give some insights? Alternatively, using grep to search for anything in the plugin directories could work too! Hmm, I’ve got some options to explore.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8DEwWrN2rRa9sA08xvVCJhtW|fc_0f4b6da1e457fee30169bbd0af306c819191e11b6008d4f0d8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw -maxdepth 4 \\( -iname \"*cli*anything*\" -o -iname \"*anything*cli*\" \\) | head -n 50","workdir":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"find /home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw -maxdepth 4 \\\\( -iname \\\"*cli*anything*\\\" -o -iname \\\"*anything*cli*\\\" \\\\) | head -n 50\",\"workdir\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":143,"output":157,"cacheRead":26880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27180,"cost":{"input":0.0003575,"output":0.002355,"cacheRead":0.006719999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0094325}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773916325442}}
